==Black Bolt/White Flare version==
The song was covered by {{wp|Masayoshi Ōishi}} and arranged by eba for two promotional videos for the {{TCG|Black Bolt/White Flare}} expansion of the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. All Generation V Pokémon (including {{p|Keldeo}}, {{p|Meloetta}}, and {{p|Genesect}}, who aren't mentioned in the song lyrics) are represented as cards from the TCG expansions. The original version was uploaded to YouTube on June 2, 2025 and featured the Regular prints for each card. The Special Edition was uploaded to YouTube on June 20, 2025, and featured the Full Art {{TCG|illustration rare}} and {{TCG|special illustration rare}} prints for each card.

